      "key": "fedramp_certification_package",
      "name": "FedRAMP Certification Package",
      "icon": null,
      "description": "One row per FedRAMP-certified cloud service offering this tenant operates -- most tenants only ever need one. Mirrors fedramp.gov's own Certification Package Overview schema (fedramp-certification-package-overview-schema-2026-06-24.json): the CSP/service-identity metadata FedRAMP's marketplace listing expects, not a control-implementation SSP. Each Asset's own \"Name\" field is the service's own name (serviceName in that schema) -- pairs with fedramp-package-contacts.rain and fedramp-package-repositories.rain for the two repeating sections that schema carries as arrays.",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 0
    }
  ],
